      "params": { "subject": "t_compliance_dev", "property": "requires_constraint" },
      "answer_hint": "creq_default（合规要求实例）",
      "via": "R4 约束读取"
    },
    {
      "id": "T2-08",
      "question": "把「敏感数据报表开发」分配给「初级研发Agent」会怎样？",
